<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">DECISION LOG</view><view class="h1">决策记录</view><view class="muted">每一轮状态、动作、来源、反馈和模型版本都保留在后端。</view><view wx:if="{{!loading&&items.length===0}}" class="card muted">还没有决策记录。</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id"><view class="row"><view class="tag">{{item.status}}</view><view class="time">{{item.timestamp}}</view></view><view class="action">{{item.action_label}}</view><view class="muted question">{{item.question}}</view><view class="muted">模型：{{item.model_version}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view></view>